    "Deleting your member account removes it and its data from Purrdr right away. Subscriptions billed by Apple continue until you cancel them in Settings." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "刪除會員會立即從 Purrdr 移除會員與它的資料。由 Apple 收費的訂閱會持續，直到你在「設定」中取消。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Diagnostics include the app version, iOS version, number of hosts, and herdr version — never host names, addresses, user names, or conversations." : {
